{"step_index":288,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-11T18:46:21Z","thinking":"**Simplifying the target inequality**\n\nThe initial approach is overly complex. The core goal is an inequality: `V1.card + 2 * V2.card ≤ romanWeight f`.  `romanWeight f` equals `∑ v ∈ univ, (f v : ℕ)`. Since all terms are non-negative, `∑ v ∈ univ, (f v : ℕ) ≥ ∑ v ∈ (V1 ∪ V2), (f v : ℕ)`. The latter simplifies to `∑ v ∈ V1, (f v : ℕ) + ∑ v ∈ V2, (f v : ℕ)`.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"import Mathlib\nimport LeanProject.GraphInvariantsComputable\n\nopen SimpleGraph\n\nlemma sum_le_romanWeight {V : Type*} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V] (f : V → Fin 3) :\n    (Finset.univ.filter (fun v => f v = 1)).card +\n    2 * (Finset.univ.filter (fun v => f v = 2)).card ≤ GraphCalc.romanWeight f := by\n  unfold GraphCalc.romanWeight\n  let V1 := Finset.univ.filter (fun v => f v = 1)\n  let V2 := Finset.univ.filter (fun v => f v = 2)\n  have hdisj : Disjoint V1 V2 := by\n    rw [Finset.disjoint_filter]\n    intro x _ h1 h2\n    have h12 : (1 : Fin 3) = (2 : Fin 3) := h1.symm.trans h2\n    revert h12\n    decide\n  have h1 : ∑ v ∈ V1, (f v : ℕ) = V1.card := by\n    have : ∀ v ∈ V1, (f v : ℕ) = 1 := by\n      intro v hv\n      rw [Finset.mem_filter] at hv\n      rw [hv.2]\n      rfl\n    rw [Finset.sum_congr rfl this, Finset.sum_const, nsmul_eq_mul, mul_one]\n  have h2 : ∑ v ∈ V2, (f v : ℕ) = 2 * V2.card := by\n    have : ∀ v ∈ V2, (f v : ℕ) = 2 := by\n      intro v hv\n      rw [Finset.mem_filter] at hv\n      rw [hv.2]\n      rfl\n    rw [Finset.sum_congr rfl this, Finset.sum_const, nsmul_eq_mul, mul_comm]\n  have hsub : V1 ∪ V2 ⊆ Finset.univ := Finset.subset_univ _\n  have h_le := Finset.sum_le_sum_of_subset_of_nonneg hsub (fun _ _ _ => Nat.zero_le _)\n  rw [Finset.sum_union hdisj, h1, h2] at h_le\n  exact h_le\n","Description":"Testing sum_le_romanWeight in scratch_test.lean","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_40a99333/scratch_test.lean","toolAction":"Writing sum_le_romanWeight in scratch_test.lean","toolSummary":"Write sum_le_romanWeight"}}]}
